Tool Calling allows an LLM/agent to invoke external functions or APIs.

Example tools:

search_web()
calculate()
get_weather()
query_database()
send_email()

User:

What is 25 × 40?

Agent can call:

calculator(25 * 40)

Result:

1000
Why tools are important

LLMs are not inherently connected to your:

Database
APIs
Files
Applications
Real-time systems

Tools give them access.
